Package: ggpatchy
Title: Simple Pattern Overlays for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Timothy", "Barrett", email = "dr.timothy.j.barrett@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a 'pattern' aesthetic for ggplot2 geoms that maps
    discrete variables to hatch, crosshatch, dot, and other overlay patterns
    rendered via grid graphics. Patterns are clipped correctly to arbitrary
    shapes and render cleanly at any resolution.
